BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:elafonisos-elafonisos-liberation-anniversary-and-agios-spyridon-process-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270709
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270713
SUMMARY:Liberation anniversary and Agios Spyridon procession\, Elafonisos
LOCATION:Elafonisos\, Elafonisos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Elafonisos celebrates its union with Greece (6 July 1850) and the consecration of its harbour church together: bells and flags on the 6th\, and on the 9th a hierarchical liturgy with the Metropolitan of Monemvasia and Sparta followed by a procession of the icon of Agios Spyridon around the harbour with children in costume\, then cultural performances on the harbour square in the evening. Early July is quieter and cheaper than August on the island.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/elafonisos/#elafonisos-liberation-anniversary-and-agios-spyridon-process
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/elafonisos/#elafonisos-liberation-anniversary-and-agios-spyridon-process
END:VEVENT
